<title>POLAND: Kable plans no 1996 payout.</title>
<headline>Kable plans no 1996 payout.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish cable maker Kable SA plans no 1996 payout and wants to earmark its 1996 net profit of 1.6 million zlotys for reserve capital, the company said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Kable said the management's proposal would be voted at the firm's general shareholders meeting on June 12.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
